# PART B — THE SPEC

## B0. WHY THE LAST 50 AUDITS WERE BULLSHIT

1. Read a stale local clone, called it truth. 2. Counted a code clone, printed it as a prod number (2,827 vs live
2,828). 3. Called a code-read "VERIFIED" — exists+wired is not correct. 4. Proved a reverse link / picker / nav by a
route string; a route that renders an empty tab is a dead link that looks alive. 5. Declared `0` without the app-path
re-run. 6. No mutation-proven guard. 7. Force-merged / faked green. 8. Wrote toward a RETIRE table. 9. Silence on a
missing link (must be `N/A(reason)` + owning block). 10. Passed a live COUNT off as a proven CHAIN. **11. Audited a
shallow SUBSET — "linkage, picker, design" — and called a system with dead `+Add new` buttons, 404 links, and
unwalked reverse chains "complete." Complete = DoD A–E + VERIFY 1–8, exercised live (§B8/§B12).**

## B1. THREE SOURCES OF TRUTH

| Fact | Source | How |
|---|---|---|
| Schema (tables/cols/enums/RLS/grants) | Neon PROD `information_schema`/`pg_catalog` | RLS-immune; never a migration file/memory |
| Counts/dollars/"0 rows" — EXISTENCE | Neon PROD live query | full-bypass OK; fills NUMBER CELL only (Rule 10) |
| App-visibility, linkage, picker, nav | Neon PROD **as `ih35_app`** (app-path GUC) **or the live app/endpoint** | click it / call it; returns the row |
| Code (routes/services/components/FKs) | current `origin/main` (pull --ff-only first) | read at a named SHA; record SHA |
| "Wired live / deployed" | deployed SHA | `healthz/shallow` version == merge sha; then exercise |

## B2. PROVENANCE — three tiers, no claim without evidence

**PROD-VERIFIED** (live row/endpoint/click-through/guard) is the only "done." **`[AUDIT — RE-VERIFY LIVE]`** =
code-read at a SHA, a to-do. **`UNVERIFIED — <blocker>`** = named blocker + Step-1 reproduce. A live count on a
tier-2 row keeps it tier-2 (Rule 10).

## B3. THE CHAIN-WALK — forward AND reverse

For each hop: name the FK column + canonical target (`to_regclass`, non-RETIRE); prove populated on real prod rows
(app path). Reverse hop proven ONLY by executing the reverse query/endpoint and returning the row. 0 parent rows →
`UNVERIFIED — 0 rows in <table>; Step-1 create via <wizard>, re-run`. Money terminus → balanced JE from the existing
poster (`postSourceTransaction`), reuse it, no new GL math.

