`driver_finance.*` (RETIRE `payroll.*`,`settlement.*`) · `mdata.qbo_*` (RETIRE `accounting.qbo_*`) · `banking.*`
(RETIRE `bank.*`) · `maintenance.*` (RETIRE `maint.*`) · vendors `mdata.vendors` (WO picker must stop writing
